Case 1: sum=1, size=1, exclude=0. Loop over masks. Only mask with popcount=1 and sum=1 is mask=0b1 (digit 1). So buffer[0]=1, results=1. Sorting does nothing. Return slice with [1]. Expected [0b1] which is 1. Good.

